    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beyond Silence</strong> is an atmospheric first-person horror game with elements of puzzles and survival. The player must explore an abandoned house tied to the dark past of the main character, collect items, find notes, solve mysteries, and hide from an unknown threat. You play as James, a former surgeon who once took part in secret experiments in an attempt to save his terminally ill daughter. After a tragic failure, he disappeared \u2014 but now, a mysterious letter brings him back to the very place where it all went wrong. The house has long been abandoned, but something still lingers within its walls \u2014 whispers, shadows, and what he once created. Use your flashlight and batteries, hide in closets, manage a limited inventory, and uncover the truth step by step. Jump scares, a tense atmosphere, and a story that will fully unfold in the second part await you.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beyond Silence</strong> is an atmospheric first-person horror game with elements of puzzles and survival. The player must explore an abandoned house tied to the dark past of the main character, collect items, find notes, solve mysteries, and hide from an unknown threat. You play as James, a former surgeon who once took part in secret experiments in an attempt to save his terminally ill daughter. After a tragic failure, he disappeared \u2014 but now, a mysterious letter brings him back to the very place where it all went wrong. The house has long been abandoned, but something still lingers within its walls \u2014 whispers, shadows, and what he once created. Use your flashlight and batteries, hide in closets, manage a limited inventory, and uncover the truth step by step. Jump scares, a tense atmosphere, and a story that will fully unfold in the second part await you.</p>",
    "short_description": "Beyond Silence is a first-person psychological horror where you play as James, a former surgeon who returns to the house of his past. The dark rooms, creaking floors, and forgotten notes hide the horrors he himself had a hand in. But the past won't let him go and it speaks to him through the silence",
